{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infernal Chess is a dark fantasy chess game set in the fiery depths of hell. Battle on a volcanic chessboard with creature-themed pieces and master strategic gameplay as you navigate the intense atmosphere of the inferno!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264310/extras/340e268c945bb5cb6d3103455b8ded6a.webp?t=1772360866\" width=612 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264310/extras/9966d67d0e4a8766f52670cbf82b0e9f.poster.avif?t=1772360866\" width=600 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264310/extras/9966d67d0e4a8766f52670cbf82b0e9f.webm?t=1772360866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264310/extras/9966d67d0e4a8766f52670cbf82b0e9f.mp4?t=1772360866\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Infernal Chess</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infernal Chess is a dark fantasy twist on the classic game of chess, set against a backdrop of a fiery volcanic landscape deep in the heart of hell. Engage in strategic battles on a unique 3D chessboard, where every move is enhanced by the eerie ambiance and dramatic creature-themed pieces that bring the infernal world to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264310/extras/541fa00402c79bfb405bcf348ed2e86f.webp?t=1772360866\" width=612 height=40 /></span></p>